CHAPTER.VERS:
Therefore say to the sons of Israel, I am Yahweh, and I will bring you

          {+}
         out from under the burdens of the Egyptians, and I will rid you

          {+}
         out of their slavery, and I will redeem you

          {+}
         with an outstretched arm, and with great judgments:

and I will take you

          {+}
         to be my people, and I will be your

          {+}
         God; and you

          {+}
         will know that I am Yahweh your

          {+}
         God, who brings you

          {+}
         out from under the burdens of the Egyptians.

And I will bring you

          {+}
         in to the land which I swore to give to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob; and I will give it to you

          {+}
         for a heritage: I am Yahweh.
